### � Bug Fixes

**1. Countdown Négatif** (`lifecycle-panel.tsx`)
```typescript
// AVANT: Crash si scheduledDeletion null
const daysRemaining = differenceInDays(new Date(guild.scheduledDeletion), new Date());

// APRÈS: Gestion null safe
const daysRemaining = guild.scheduledDeletion 
  ? differenceInDays(new Date(guild.scheduledDeletion), new Date())
  : null;
```

**2. LiveStats NaN** (`super-admin-actions.ts`)
```typescript
// Ajout fallbacks pour éviter NaN dans trends
profilesTrend: Math.round(((total - lastWeek) / (lastWeek || 1)) * 100) || 0
```

